ribbit-core is a C99 port of the Rattlegram modem:

  Rattlegram, https://github.com/aicodix/rattlegram
  mirrored as https://github.com/wave-owl/rattlegram
  tag v1.19, commit 4df0f3af3c6da63f0d70512392e80c7a31b72099
  app/src/main/cpp/*.hh (the aicodix DSP and code library headers bundled with the app)

